    {
      "text": "City: all planning entitlements have now expired. Two existing homes were demolished.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001233"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City page: 308 Phelps Road was 2.19 acres with a 1920 home, 310 Phelps Road 0.93 acres with a 1937 home, plus a 0.10-acre strip (APN 049-292-060). Plan: nine lots, nine homes, eight with ADUs; Spring Valley Way extended to serve six homes; rezoning from RS-3 to RS-6. The applicant requested an extension of entitlements through April 2026; the city states all entitlements have expired.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003927"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "BMR plan unit table: all nine homes 4 bedrooms, 2,540 to 4,228 sq ft including garage. Letter signed by Nicole Gittleson, Executive Vice President, Clarum Homes, on behalf of applicant/owner Phelps San Carlos LLC.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003925"
      ]
    },
